cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Router default passwords and login IPs
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it and link back to
  https://ssid.ai/routers
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: ssid.ai
    website: https://ssid.ai
    city: Dubai
    country: AE
repository-code: https://github.com/Drumworks/router-default-passwords
url: https://ssid.ai/routers
date-released: 2026-08-27
version: 2026-08-27
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of 391 router, gateway, mesh and access-point models with, for
  each one, the default login IP, the default admin username, the default
  password (or an explicit reason there is no universal one), the credential
  type, factory-reset steps, and the manufacturer URL the values came from.
  Every row is sourced from the manufacturer's own documentation across 131
  distinct domains; a model that cannot be verified against an official source
  is excluded rather than guessed at. 105 of the 391 models still ship a
  universal default password. Includes the Router Default-Credential Compliance
  Index, which measures the share of tracked models that no longer ship one.
keywords:
  - router default password
  - default gateway IP
  - network hardware
  - IoT security
  - default credentials
  - PSTI
  - Cyber Resilience Act
